From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aphrody-dev <contact@aphrody.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 05:12:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] WSLGd: WSL2_COMPOSITOR switch (weston | hyprland-nested
 | hyprland-headless)

Selects the compositor stack from WSL2_COMPOSITOR (settable in .wslgconfig
[system-distro-env]). Weston RDP/RAIL stays the Windows-facing stack in every
mode; the Hyprland modes start Hyprland next to it and fall back to weston when
Hyprland or a DRM render node is missing. Mode parsing and launch argv live in
a dependency-free header with a unit test (meson test compositor).
---
 Dockerfile                      |  3 ++
 WSLGd/Compositor.h              | 88 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 WSLGd/main.cpp                  | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++
 WSLGd/meson.build               |  3 ++
 WSLGd/tests/compositor_test.cpp | 45 +++++++++++++++++
 config/hyprland-headless.lua    |  8 +++
 config/hyprland-nested.lua      | 13 +++++
 7 files changed, 215 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 WSLGd/Compositor.h
 create mode 100644 WSLGd/tests/compositor_test.cpp
 create mode 100644 config/hyprland-headless.lua
 create mode 100644 config/hyprland-nested.lua

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
index 829c9ef..a9f08d2 100644
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -461,6 +461,9 @@ COPY config/wsl.conf /etc/wsl.conf
 COPY config/weston.ini /home/wslg/.config/weston.ini
 COPY config/local.conf /etc/fonts/local.conf
 
+# BunOS: Hyprland configs used by WSL2_COMPOSITOR=hyprland-nested|hyprland-headless.
+COPY config/hyprland-nested.lua config/hyprland-headless.lua /etc/wslg/
+
 # Copy default icon file.
